<title>USA: Healthsource delays meeting to July 31.</title>
<headline>Healthsource delays meeting to July 31.</headline>
<dateline>HOOKSETT, N.H. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthsource Inc said on Friday it delayed to July 31 from July 28 its annual meeting, at which shareholders are to vote on the proposed merger with a subsidiary of CIGNA Corp.</p>
<p>The record date for the meeting now is set for June 30, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Healthsource provides managed-care health services.</p>
